{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的感受短句和意象比较密集，部分时刻会打断叙事的连续阅读；Y的完整长句更容易一口气读懂。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】把每段最重要的心理动作凸显出来，短句分层也方便观众一边听音乐一边快速抓取信息；感受词还能按音乐进程出现，不必一次消化所有内容。更重要的是，它把人物从害怕给对方负担、享受亲近、担心失去，到逐渐不再隐藏喜欢的心理变化交代得更细，前后水面、船、歌声等意象也形成了呼应。Y的叙事虽然更连贯，但长句不容易快速定位重点，部分感受词又偏概括或直接强化情绪，细腻程度和音乐同步的层次感不如X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "79ec8ece-fc01-4ea3-a056-d802bb68db3c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T193042406869Z", "elapsed_seconds": 86.562, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:32:08.979981+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9578b2ae23e49b8ce42cfe2b2084e053f24b7a754488b9b7637c5571881141e8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt